<article class="env-lemma" id="0FZG">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FZG">Lemma <span data-tag="0FZG">56.5.6</span>.</a> In Lemma <a href="/tag/0FZD" data-tag="0FZD">56.5.2</a> or in Lemma <a href="/tag/0GPA" data-tag="0GPA">56.5.5</a> if $F$ is an exact functor, then the corresponding object $\mathcal{K}$ of $\mathit{QCoh}(\mathcal{O}_{X \times _ R Y})$ is flat over $X$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      We may assume $X$ is affine, so we are in the case of Lemma <a href="/tag/0FZD" data-tag="0FZD">56.5.2</a>. By Lemma <a href="/tag/0FZF" data-tag="0FZF">56.5.4</a> we may assume $Y$ is affine. In the affine case the statement translates into Remark <a href="/tag/0GNX" data-tag="0GNX">56.3.5</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>